Dialogue: 10,0:01:44.75,0:01:46.71,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Destiny is mine
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.71,0:01:48.84,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}osore shitte mo
Dialogue: 10,0:01:48.84,0:01:53.26,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}subete no mirai togirenu you ni
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.26,0:01:59.52,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Shoot a thread of light
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.48,0:02:09.44,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}itami o norikoeru tabi
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.44,0:02:19.16,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}kokoro wa eiri ni togisumasareru (Never give up)
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.16,0:02:27.50,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}kurikaesareru shukumei no saihate de
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.50,0:02:31.30,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}hikari chiru umi ni chikau
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.96,0:02:33.97,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Getting through
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.97,0:02:36.18,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}ikiru imi o
Dialogue: 10,0:02:36.18,0:02:41.68,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}sekai ni nokosu kara
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.48,0:02:44.48,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Heaven’s falling down
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.48,0:02:46.73,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}sora otoshite mo
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.73,0:02:51.40,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}nozomi o kudakou kyouki no kami no
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.40,0:02:53.49,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Destiny is mine
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.49,0:02:55.53,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}osore shitte mo
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.53,0:03:00.03,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}subete no mirai togirenu you ni
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.03,0:03:04.50,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}tomosu honoo ga
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.50,0:03:10.67,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}inochi no kirameki (Destiny will begin tonight)
Dialogue: 10,0:01:44.75,0:01:46.71,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Destiny is mine
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.71,0:01:48.84,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Though fear may weigh me down
Dialogue: 10,0:01:48.84,0:01:53.26,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}I won't let our futures be cut short
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.26,0:01:59.52,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}I'll shoot a thread of light
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.48,0:02:09.44,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Each time I overcome pain
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.44,0:02:19.16,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}My heart grows ever sharper (Never give up)
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.16,0:02:27.50,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}At the far reaches of this looping fate
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.50,0:02:31.30,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}I pledge to the ocean that refracts light
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.96,0:02:33.97,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Getting through
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.97,0:02:36.18,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Even if here I fall
Dialogue: 10,0:02:36.18,0:02:41.68,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}I'll pass down the meaning of life
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.48,0:02:44.48,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Heaven’s falling down
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.48,0:02:46.73,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Though the skies may fall on me
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.73,0:02:51.40,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Still I will shatter the ambitions of a mad god
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.40,0:02:53.49,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Destiny is mine
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.49,0:02:55.53,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Though fear may weigh me down
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.53,0:03:00.03,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}I won't let our futures be cut short
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.03,0:03:04.50,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}So I light a flame
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.50,0:03:10.67,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}The glimmer of life (Destiny will begin tonight)
Dialogue: 10,0:22:14.98,0:22:20.07,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Although you think I cope
Dialogue: 10,0:22:20.07,0:22:25.28,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}My head is filled with hope
Dialogue: 10,0:22:25.28,0:22:34.17,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Of some place other than here
Dialogue: 10,0:22:35.25,0:22:40.26,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Although you think I smile
Dialogue: 10,0:22:40.26,0:22:45.59,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Inside and all the while
Dialogue: 10,0:22:45.59,0:22:53.85,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I'm wondering about my destiny
Dialogue: 10,0:22:54.48,0:23:00.44,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I'm thinking about
Dialogue: 10,0:23:00.44,0:23:05.36,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}All the things
Dialogue: 10,0:23:05.36,0:23:10.33,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I'd like to do
Dialogue: 10,0:23:10.33,0:23:14.62,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}In my life
Dialogue: 10,0:23:14.62,0:23:19.38,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I'm a dreamer
Dialogue: 10,0:23:19.38,0:23:24.63,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}A distant dreamer
Dialogue: 10,0:23:24.63,0:23:30.14,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Dreaming far away
Dialogue: 10,0:23:30.14,0:23:34.23,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}From today

